            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controlla che non ci siano errori di battitura."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "오타가 있는지 확인하십시오."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your inbox and click the confirmation link to finish subscribing. If it is not there, check your spam folder, or the Promotions tab in Gmail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请到邮箱点击确认链接完成订阅。如果收件箱没有，请查一下垃圾邮件；Gmail 则要看「推广」标签页。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check your inbox and click the confirmation link to finish subscribing. If it is not there, check your spam folder, or the Promotions tab in Gmail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請到收件匣點一下確認連結完成訂閱。如果找不到，請查看垃圾郵件；Gmail則要看「促銷內容」標籤頁。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メールを確認し、確認リンクをクリックすると登録が完了します。受信トレイに見当たらない場合は迷惑メールフォルダを、Gmailでは「プロモーション」タブを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sieh in deinem Postfach nach und klicke auf den Bestätigungslink, um das Abo abzuschließen. Falls die E-Mail nicht dort ist, sieh im Spam-Ordner nach – bei Gmail im Tab „Werbung“."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consultez votre boîte de réception et cliquez sur le lien de confirmation pour finaliser l’inscription. Si vous ne le trouvez pas, regardez dans les indésirables, ou dans l’onglet Promotions de Gmail."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba tu bandeja de entrada y haz clic en el enlace de confirmación para terminar de suscribirte. Si no lo ves, busca en la carpeta de spam o en la pestaña Promociones de Gmail."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisa tu bandeja de entrada y haz clic en el enlace de confirmación para terminar de suscribirte. Si no lo encuentras, revisa tu carpeta de spam o la pestaña Promociones de Gmail."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique sua caixa de entrada e clique no link de confirmação para concluir a inscrição. Se ele não estiver lá, verifique a pasta de spam ou a aba Promoções do Gmail."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique a sua caixa de entrada e clique na hiperligação de confirmação para concluir a subscrição. Se não a encontrar, verifique a pasta de spam ou o separador Promoções do Gmail."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controlla la posta in arrivo e fai clic sul link di conferma per completare l’iscrizione. Se non lo trovi, controlla la cartella della posta indesiderata o la scheda Promozioni di Gmail."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "받은 편지함에서 확인 링크를 클릭하여 구독을 완료하십시오. 메일이 없으면 스팸 메일함이나 Gmail의 프로모션 탭을 확인하십시오."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your network connection and try again, or email support@tungstenedge.app.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈失败弹窗",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查网络后重试，或发邮件到 support@tungstenedge.app。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check your network connection and try again, or email support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查網路連線後再試一次，或寄信到support@tungstenedge.app。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ネットワーク接続を確認してもう一度お試しください。support@tungstenedge.appまでメールでご連絡いただくこともできます。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe deine Netzwerkverbindung und versuch es erneut, oder schreib eine E-Mail an support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez votre connexion réseau et réessayez, ou écrivez à support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba tu conexión de red e inténtalo de nuevo, o envía un correo a support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifica tu conexión de red e intenta de nuevo, o envía un correo a support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
